    "paperId": "doi:10.1057/s41599-026-06909-6",
    "doi": "10.1057/s41599-026-06909-6",
    "title": "Not all algorithmic controls are equal: the double-edged impact of algorithmic control dimensions on mental health and risky riding behavior among food delivery riders",
    "authors": [
